le.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Sacred Flame <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">60 feet</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">Flame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462512320" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V, S &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Instantaneous<br><br>Flame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 radiant damage. The target gains no benefit from cover for this saving throw.<br><br>The spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).</td></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462518298');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Spare the Dying <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">Touch</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">You touch a living creature that has 0 hit points</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462518298" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V, S &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Instantaneous<br><br>You touch a living creature that has 0 hit points. The creature becomes stable. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.</td></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462522890');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Guidance <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">Touch</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">You touch one willing creature (C)</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462522890" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V, S &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Concentration, Up to 1 minute<br><br>You touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one ability check of its choice. It can roll the die before or after making the ability check. The spell then ends.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="spell-level-block"><div class="spell-header" style="display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #b8860b; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><h3 style="color: #5c2509; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.2em;">Prepared Spells (Level 1)</h3></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #2b2b2b;"><tbody><tr style="text-align: left; font-size: 0.85em; color: #8b1e0b; border-bottom: 1px dashed #d4c4a8;"><th style="padding: 6px;">Spell Name</th><th style="padding: 6px;">Time</th><th style="padding: 6px;">Range</th><th style="padding: 6px;">Effect</th></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462537818');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Bless <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">30 feet</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">You bless up to three creatures of your choice within range (C)</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462537818" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V, S, M (A sprinkling of holy water.) &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Concentration, Up to 1 minute<br><br>You bless up to three creatures of your choice within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to the attack roll or saving throw.<br><br><strong style="color:#5c2509;">At Higher Levels:</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.</td></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462543431');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Cure Wounds <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">Touch</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">1d8 + MOD healing</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462543431" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V, S &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Instantaneous<br><br>A creature you touch regains a number of hit points equal to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.<br><br><strong style="color:#5c2509;">At Higher Levels:</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.</td></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462548017');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Healing Word <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">1 bonus action</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">60 feet</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">1d4 + MOD healing</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462548017" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Instantaneous<br><br>A creature of your choice that you can see within range regains hit points equal to 1d4 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.<br><br><strong style="color:#5c2509;">At Higher Levels:</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d4 for each slot level above 1st.</td></tr><tr class="epic-row-hover" style="border-bottom: none;"><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; color: #2b2b2b;" onclick="const d=document.getElementById('spell-desc-1774462554206');d.style.display=d.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';" title="Click to toggle description">Prayer of Healing <span style="font-size:0.7em;color:#94a3b8;">▼</span></td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">10 minutes</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px;">30 feet</td><td style="padding: 6px 6px 2px; color: #555;">2d8 + MOD healing</td></tr><tr id="spell-desc-1774462554206" style="display: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(244, 241, 234);"><td colspan="4" style="padding: 4px 6px 8px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #444; line-height: 1.5; background: #faf8f5; border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;"><span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Components:</span> V &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span style="color:#5c2509;font-weight:bold;font-size:0.85em;">Duration:</span> Instantaneous<br><br>Up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range each regain hit points equal to 2d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.<br><br><strong style="color:#5c2509;">At Higher Levels:</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="spell-footer" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px; background: rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #e0d6c8;"><div style="font-size: 1em; color: #5c2509; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-weight: bold;"> Level 1 Slots: <span class="slot-tracker" data-sym="☐" style="font-weight: normal; font-family: sans-serif; color: #2c3e50;">[ ☑ ☑ ☑ ☑ ]</span></div></div></div></div><div style="background: #F3EFEC;border: 1px solid #c8b99c;border-radius: 8px;padding: 20px;box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);"><details style="background: transparent; border: none; box-shadow: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;" open=""><summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 1.2em; list-style: none; outline: none; padding: 0; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="color: #b8860b; margin-right: 10px;">▶</span> Biography &amp; Notes </summary><div style="margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.6;"><p style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 0.95em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: #8b1e0b;">Personality:</strong> I see omens in everything and am tolerant of other faiths. The gods try to speak to us, we just need to listen. </p><p style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 0.95em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: #8b1e0b;">Ideals:</strong> Faith. I trust that my deity will guide my actions, I have faith that if I work hard, things will go well. (Lawful) </p><p style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 0.95em; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: #8b1e0b;">Bonds:</strong> I seek guidance through my goddess, though I fear the day I must confront those who still see me as a weapon. </p><p style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 0.95em; margin: 0px 0px 15px;"><strong style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: #8b1e0b;">Flaws:</strong> Once I pick a goal, I become obsessed with it to the detriment of everything else in my life.</p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 15.2px;"><font color="#8b1e0b" face="Cinzel, serif"><b>Other Proficiencies</b></font></span><strong style="color: rgb(139, 30, 11); font-size: 15.2px; font-family: Cinzel, serif;">:</strong><span style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 15.2px;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px;"><ul><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Light armor</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Medium armor</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Heavy armor</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Shields</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Simple weapons</span></font></li></ul></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-size: 15.2px;"><font color="#8b1e0b" face="Cinzel, serif"><b>Languages</b></font></span><strong style="color: rgb(139, 30, 11); font-size: 15.2px; font-family: Cinzel, serif;">:</strong><span style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 15.2px;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 15.2px;"></span></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 15px;"><ul><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Common</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Celestial</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Elvish</span></font></li><li><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Dwarvish</span></font></li></ul></p><hr style="color: rgb(43, 43, 43); font-size: 0.95em; border: 0px; height: 1px; background: rgb(212, 196, 168); margin: 15px 0px;"><p style="margin: 0px;"><font color="#8b1e0b" face="Cinzel, serif"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><b>Allies &amp; Organizations:</b></span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Shelter of the Faithful:</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">- Perform ceremonies of your deity</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">- Those who share your religion will support and respect you</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">- You and your companions receive free healing and care at a established presence of your faith,&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">though components needed for spells need to be provided.</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">- You have ties to a specific temple dedicated to your chosen deity, while near your temple,</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">you can&nbsp; call upon the priests for assistance, provided it is not hazardous and you remain in good standing with your temple.</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><br></span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#8b1e0b" face="Cinzel, serif"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><b>Acolyte Of Justice: The Knight Who Laid Down His Blade:</b></span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Sir Svendrick was once a young knight celebrated for his skill in battle, but each victory left him more hollow than the last. During a brutal campaign, he witnessed innocent lives lost by orders he was sworn to obey.</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#2b2b2b"><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">In the aftermath, he knelt before the statue of the Goddess of Justice and felt, for the first time, the quiet pull of a path without bloodshed. Abandoning his sword, Svendrick took up the robes of an acolyte, vowing to serve justice not through violence but through truth, fairness, and protection of the defenseless - though he fears the day he must confront those who still see him as a weapon.</span></font></p></div></details></div></div></div>